s are unstated\nWhy: any start point would be mine and not the policy's.\n\nTake the recommended answers, or correct any of them?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7781,"cache_read_input_tokens":84078,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7781},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2bdeaa9b-cf42-495a-88e5-c9d2cda9b800","uuid":"b91424cd-d47e-4b42-8d3f-951fb7b7b609","timestamp":"2026-10-30T06:35:04.896Z","request_id":"req_011CgXxT9NcbwC3U4zMXoDz4"}
